# PSP cheat pack
# Serial: ULES-00277
# Title: Tenchu: Time of the Assassins [EU]
# Source: custom camera patch converted from CWCheat V18.3 MODE-BYTE FIX


# CAMERA V18.3 - MODE-BYTE FIX / GRAPPLING SAFE / HIGH-RANGE
#
# FIX: REQUIRED is _C1 (enabled). All optional overrides remain _C0.

#
# IMPORTANT: enable only this camera version.
#
# V18.3 FIX:
# PlayCam+0xC0 is a byte field. V18/V18.1/V18.2 incorrectly used:
#   lw  t1, 0xC0(t0)   -> read 0x4B010001
# V18.3 uses:
#   lbu t1, 0xC0(t0)   -> read 0x01
# The old comparison therefore bypassed the custom orbit on every frame.

# Do not enable Camera V16 or Camera V17 at the same time.
#
# V18 applies the custom orbit only when:
#   active PlayCam mode == 1;
#   the render object matches PlayCam+0xA0;
#   the camera target remains within ~300 units of the player.
#
# Grappling-hook, scripted and other special cameras bypass the custom orbit
# and use the game's native final camera builder.
#
# State 0x08803F44:
#   0 custom orbit
#   1 L/native lock-on
#   2 R/native manual
#   3 special/grappling camera native bypass

