# -------------------- SMOOTHING PRESETS --------------------
#
# Alpha meaning:
#   higher number = faster/harder response;
#   lower number  = slower/softer response.
#
# Four values per preset:
#   orbit        = X/Z response while RX is active;
#   follow       = X/Z following while RX is neutral;
#   vertical     = Y response while RY is active;
#   verticalFollow = Y following while RY is neutral.


